(text "WIZ850io: one footprint with both 1x6 sockets (J1 = pads 1-6, J2 = pads 7-12), rows 17.78 mm (0.7 in) apart." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 947ae275-5961-4855-85a9-6de1aa2ac930))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 464008db-5962-407a-865b-dbaf474c25e4))
(text "microSD on the ESP32-S3 SD host, 1-bit mode. JP1 can disconnect DAT0 from GPIO3 (a strapping pin) if it upsets boot." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 86e64246-21df-4d28-884a-f5a3941a833d))
